# Field notes on the estuary

The tide withdrew under a pale September sky. This source stays long enough
to show the writing measure without becoming a wall of placeholder text.

## Morning transect

- Reed line: quiet
- Mudflat: fresh tracks
- Channel marker: two terns

The prior survey is in the [Estuary archive](archive.djot){rel="cites"}.

